{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "duo_flux_divergence_g1_fixture",
    "description": "AST-expansion conformance fixture for the duo continuity flux-divergence rule flux_divergence_duo_g1 (Ng=1) at N=4. A consuming model importing grids/duo/grid.esm, grids/duo/rules/duo_extend.esm and grids/duo/rules/flux_divergence_duo_g1.esm (N=4 at each edge), declaring per-tile A-grid prognostics dp,ua,va[tile,x,y] and an observed tendency dpdt[tile,x,y] that applies flux_divergence_duo_g1 to the duo_extend'd fields and the geometry chain (duo_node_cart/duo_cell_center/duo_cos_alpha/duo_cell_area). Forces the 9.6.3 fixpoint to expand the interior-region aggregate, the inlined volume-mean reconstruction, the LMARS solve, the sign-upwind, and the inlined duo_arc_length/duo_tangent_cos face geometry. Pins the byte-identical post-lowering AST across bindings.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "conformance",
      "ast",
      "grid:duo",
      "rule:flux_divergence_duo_g1"
    ]
  },
